        {
            "sceneId": "scene-007",
            "title": "知识模块 C：水稻成熟期",
            "dialogue": [
                {
                    "speakerId": "NEXUS",
                    "text": "在最后一个评估节点前，系统将输出「水稻成熟期」的知识摘要。",
                    "emotion": "thoughtful"
                },
                {
                    "speakerId": "NEXUS",
                    "text": "水稻成熟期分为乳熟期、蜡熟期和完熟期三个阶段。乳熟期籽粒充满乳状淀粉液，蜡熟期籽粒变硬呈蜡状，完熟期籽粒完全硬化。",
                    "emotion": "explaining"
                },
                {
                    "speakerId": "NEXUS",
                    "text": "完熟期是最佳收获期，此时籽粒含水量降至 20%~25%，产量和品质均达到峰值。该指标是判断收获时机的权威依据。",
                    "emotion": "informative"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "choiceId": "c-scene-007-1",
                    "questionId": "f1064095-6e61-4933-a1b8-2506fc14b7ce",
                    "text": "知识摘要已读取，继续。",
                    "nextSceneId": "scene-008",
                    "scoreDelta": 0,
                    "knowledgePointId": "c9d0e1f2-a3b4-4c5d-6e7f-8090a1b2c3d3"
                }
            ],
            "knowledgeBindings": [
                {
                    "knowledgePointId": "c9d0e1f2-a3b4-4c5d-6e7f-8090a1b2c3d3",
                    "purpose": "EXPLAIN",
                    "questionId": null
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "sceneId": "scene-008",
            "title": "评估节点 3：水稻成熟期判断标准",
            "dialogue": [
                {
                    "speakerId": "NEXUS",
                    "text": "系统已生成最终评估问题，请作答。",
                    "emotion": "challenging"
                },
                {
                    "speakerId": "NEXUS",
                    "text": "关于「水稻成熟期判断标准」，以下哪个说法是正确的？",
                    "emotion": "questioning"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "choiceId": "c-scene-008-d2",
                    "questionId": "5e96c22a-8079-4104-ab3c-e7828c2584c2",
                    "text": "乳熟期籽粒充满乳浆时是最佳收获期，此时产量最高",
                    "nextSceneId": "scene-009",
                    "scoreDelta": 0,
                    "knowledgePointId": "c9d0e1f2-a3b4-4c5d-6e7f-8090a1b2c3d3",
                    "answerKind": "CHOICE",
                    "correct": false
                },
                {
                    "choiceId": "c-scene-008-correct",
                    "questionId": "5e96c22a-8079-4104-ab3c-e7828c2584c2",
                    "text": "水稻成熟期分为乳熟期、蜡熟期和完熟期，完熟期籽粒含水量降至 20%~25%，是最佳收获期",
                    "nextSceneId": "scene-009",
                    "scoreDelta": 1,
                    "knowledgePointId": "c9d0e1f2-a3b4-4c5d-6e7f-8090a1b2c3d3",
                    "answerKind": "CHOICE",
                    "correct": true
                },
                {
                    "choiceId": "c-scene-008-d3",
                    "questionId": "5e96c22a-8079-4104-ab3c-e7828c2584c2",
                    "text": "成熟期判断与籽粒含水量无关，主要看穗部颜色变化",
                    "nextSceneId": "scene-009",
                    "scoreDelta": 0,
                    "knowledgePointId": "c9d0e1f2-a3b4-4c5d-6e7f-8090a1b2c3d3",
